lank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_END_Courtyard_KitchenNote\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">f6d667a8-b06f-4b05-baf2-81f7ee10aa63</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f6d667a8-b06f-4b05-baf2-81f7ee10aa63\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:f6d667a8-b06f-4b05-baf2-81f7ee10aa63\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Can be found at <a href=\"/wiki/High_Hall\" title=\"High Hall\">High Hall</a> at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;342&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;121</span> behind a locked door</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>From the office of His Grace, Judge Marthius Warman, a humble request to the chef to ensure that henceforth his lunch must always include the finest Sahuagin caviar.\n</p><p><br>\n[Beneath the formal text in small, neat, handwriting.]\n</p><p><br>\nP.S  Should the kitchen be unable to source such fine fare on short notice, it may be worth noting that his Honour's palate is unable to identify the difference between Sahuagin eggs and salmon roe.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715030202\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.045 sec